h_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p036","quote":"釐公五年，鄭相子駟朝釐公，釐公不禮。子駟怒，使廚人藥殺釐公，赴諸侯曰「釐公暴病卒」。立釐公子嘉，嘉時年五歳，是爲簡公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p060","quote":"厲王之子，得封於鄭。代職司徒，緇衣在詠。虢、鄶獻邑，祭祝專命。莊既犯王，厲亦奔命。居櫟克入，夢蘭毓慶。伯服生囚，叔瞻屍聘。釐、簡之後，公室不競。負黍雖還，韓哀日盛。"}],"rationale":"依本篇名字、是為、世系及連續事件暫接異稱；同諡不同國分開，建子勝與聲公勝不合併，如兄弟為譬喻不作親屬。述贊與正文不算獨立來源，省稱、古字與校勘仍待核。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p035","text":"十四年，成公卒，子惲立。是爲釐公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m035-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"成公","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m035-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"惲","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m035-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p036","text":"釐公五年，鄭相子駟朝釐公，釐公不禮。子駟怒，使廚人藥殺釐公，赴諸侯曰「釐公暴病卒」。立釐公子嘉，嘉時年五歳，是爲簡公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m036-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m036-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"子駟","kind":"person","person_id":"7hl_jbv_m5y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m036-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m036-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m036-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"子駟","kind":"person","person_id":"7hl_jbv_m5y","status":"contextual_provis